@startuml
 title sd — Collect a successful main revision
 actor Contributor
 participant "GitHub hosted tests" as CI
 participant "Fixed local collector" as Collector
 participant "Disposable scanner" as Scanner
 participant SonarQube
 Contributor -> CI: Push main revision
 CI -> CI: Test and produce SHA-bound reports
 Collector -> CI: Poll eligible completed runs
 CI --> Collector: Run and artifact metadata
 Collector -> Collector: Verify repository, event, branch, workflow and SHA
 alt Provenance invalid or reports missing
 Collector -> CI: Exact-SHA error status
 else Provenance valid
 Collector -> CI: Fetch exact source and reports
 Collector -> Collector: Validate bounded archive and LCOV paths
 Collector -> Scanner: Trusted configuration and read-only data
 Scanner -> SonarQube: Submit exact revision and await gate
 SonarQube --> Scanner: Result or explicit failure
 Scanner --> Collector: Analysis and gate outcome
 Collector -> CI: Exact-SHA status
 end
 note over Collector
No GitHub runner registration
No downloaded repository code execution
end note
@enduml
